84:fixture root (not a path already admitted by this review):
85:
86:- Each engine record goes to `$FIXTURE/` + `target.slice('compiled/'.length)`.
87:  This yields `engine/dist/**`, `engine/package.json`, `support/errors.js`.
88:  Do not flatten the support directory. Do not symlink to old author scratch.
89:- Normal adapter, at30ac:
