119:## Existing instrumentation: reuse rules, not old execution scope
120:
121:At30ac, `tests/integration/node-public-author-20260829/` contains:
122:`node-policy.mjs`, `node-load-guard.mjs`, `internal-loader-arguments.mjs`,
123:`node-batch.mjs`, `public-node-v2.mjs`, `run-v3.mjs`, `run-v4.mjs`.
124:Their exact executor pins and selected bodies are captured in this sidecar.
125:The internal-loader helper is byte-identical at several accepted executor paths;
126:the generated content-pin table names the first matching strict-mode locator.
127:Use the explicitly named public-author locator above when staging that recipe;
128:do not infer a different required subtree from a duplicate-content hash.
129:The old runner-node.mjs.data fragment still has the original engine-only path
130:test; **run-v3.mjs:136** is the corrected actual inclusion of
