133:Existing `node-policy.json` fields are `log`, `maximum`, `workerEntry`, `adapters`.
134:The policy observes create/exit, refuses nested application Workers and verifies:
135:empty env/argv; stdout/stderr true; resourceLimits old32/young8/code8/stack4MiB;
136:workerData exact `request,entry,identity,sab`; SAB197056bytes; request exact
137:`profile,selector,source,program,filename,cwd,argv,env,grants,limits` and
138:NP1-CJS-WRQ-L-SYNC-1. Rebind log/entry/adapter paths to each owned layout.
139:The raw adapter identity check alone is not a file hash guard.
140:
