144:`node-load-guard.mjs` uses registerHooks, requires regular non-symlink files,
145:checks size/hash before import (262144bytes/file), checks per-importer builtin
146:edges, rejects unlisted bare package fallback/query/fragment, and emits
147:`@@NODE_LOAD` records. The manifest itself is bounded2MiB, loads2048. The
148:guard/policy bootstrap files and their config must first be outer-authenticated;
149:self-declared identity is not admission. Refresh and compare complete membership,
150:not only previously present paths, after materialization and every move.
